{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0503_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b68eb9e2d34d1e007e8b3d8f9c0d21cca7ebe23165a3acce19142082a56cceb0", "ja": "（最近、星梨花が遅くまで自主レッスンをしている。\n頑張るのはいいが、無理をしてないか心配だ……）", "zh": "（最近，星梨花经常自主练习到很晚。努力是好事，可我还是担心她是不是太勉强自己了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0503_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "be5dd089d7c3a4118de37e7d5c74f908a92314c9f0de943995c9ba151e94ae18", "ja": "お疲れさまです！　レッスンルームの鍵を……\nあれ、{$P$}さん。大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "辛苦了！练习室的钥匙……\n咦，{$P$}先生。您没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0503_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1e6588eb5619b1d5e887ff65088fd994901bf74a2dad043ba32c1c2081d206b4", "ja": "……えっ？　何がだ、星梨花？", "zh": "……诶？怎么了，星梨花？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0503_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "03c45e1c303f7453120cc68b60b92ab90be6845af75e42e071fbf9402997c885", "ja": "なんだか難しそうな顔をしてたから……\nもしかして、何か悩みごとですか？", "zh": "因为看到您一副很为难的样子……\n难道是有什么烦恼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0503_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "008f59275d9a778bccbd9abccf989e1c64276c7c657ad280ade6ab0c9908044c", "ja": "わたしじゃ頼りないかもしれないですけど、\nよかったら相談してください！", "zh": "虽然我也许靠不住，\n但如果可以的话，请跟我商量吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0503_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a402bd4ef0271e5dfeb2fc609257cdd07ebd9724eb80f7388eea33adde86bb53", "ja": "はは、ありがとう。悩みというか……\n星梨花が遅くまで頑張ってるから、気になってね。", "zh": "哈哈，谢谢。与其说是烦恼……星梨花一直努力到很晚，所以有点在意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0503_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "a5ecea71122d7a1f028946c80ef6b52379f063a5dd70cdf2b1958d5a3673e145", "ja": "あっ、わたしのことだったんですね……！\nごめんなさい、全然気づかなくて……！", "zh": "啊，原来是在说我啊……！\n对不起，我完全没注意到……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0503_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2ed8699444e20376122510ab409368939bb1edc2daf6227370208dd56a24bf31", "ja": "いやいや、練習するのは構わないんだ！\nただ、何か理由があるのかなと思って。", "zh": "不不，练习本身是没关系的！\n我只是在想，是不是有什么原因呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0503_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "775d1460f0762adc53a5f7a194cd907c5801e96eb0c4906b468c4c288ff121ea", "ja": "理由、ですか……。{$P$}さん。\n笑わないで聞いてくれるって、約束してくれますか？", "zh": "理由，是吗……{$P$}先生。\n你能答应我，听完不会笑吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0503_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d130c75dc3934975dc63d56ef4f145bf54bd9fe6e7c20b2dace50c18df1c0276", "ja": "もちろんだよ。", "zh": "那是当然了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0503_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "0e7507448e6352b5b0ac7db0e4a62b9bc6322830c0cf09df786c44a573e624bd", "ja": "実は夢を見たんです。わたしは大きな列車に乗っていて\n歌とダンスでみんなに笑顔を届けていました。", "zh": "其实我做了一个梦。我坐在一列巨大的火车上，\n用歌声和舞蹈给所有人带去笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0503_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "76b7a4919312b2e5f73281749cf843752fd98c0d1884efb4b2c141de7b897412", "ja": "でも今のわたしは、夢の中と比べると\nすごく下手だったんです……。それで……。", "zh": "可是，现在的我和梦里的自己相比，真的差得太多了……所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0503_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1e615851803a251b6a224c3c24f5ba061f9de0d98ac9d8013985492d9ba648c8", "ja": "そうか……。だから、自主レッスンをたくさん\nしてたんだな。夢の中の自分に追いつきたくて。", "zh": "这样啊……所以你才做了这么多自主练习。是想追上梦里的自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0503_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "f290ad6cb12a8e085448a73985fed37e3547a18140f516e8e243e7856f2ca842", "ja": "はい……。夢に負けたくないって思うなんて、\nもしかしてわたし、子どもっぽいんでしょうか？", "zh": "是的……。居然会想着不能输给梦中的自己，\n我是不是有点孩子气呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0503_1014_p", "source_sha256": "84f2d3d2ba4134d8a14b07859f72299a6e5ce5cb4caef9eb6d03c95e1946ce37", "ja": "そんなことないよ。多分だけど、夢の中の星梨花は、\n理想の自分だったんじゃないかな。", "zh": "没那回事。虽然只是我的猜测，梦里的星梨花，应该就是理想中的自己吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0503_1015_p", "source_sha256": "305070f8744e820ed5d91609e3e7550481bc805ef2e0baf416dfcb7c6bf1b25c", "ja": "今より先の未来では、『歌もダンスもうまくて、\nみんなに笑顔を届ける自分でいたい』って。", "zh": "在比现在更加遥远的未来，我想成为“歌唱和舞蹈都很出色，能为大家带来笑容的自己”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0503_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "51df72193b2bd4a2acd2d76ae61a257c2f0fa1d8766ede227e7a2921d173a2a2", "ja": "……そうかもしれません。劇場のみんなを見ていると\nわたしも早く上手になりたいって思って。", "zh": "……也许是这样呢。看着剧场的大家，\n我就会想自己也要快点变得厉害起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0503_1017_p", "source_sha256": "48fc2c7f2a300fb155cf30619548abf84898d9744a750eaf773388458bb50309", "ja": "焦らなくても大丈夫。星梨花はちゃんと成長してるし、\nこの先ももっともっと成長できると思うよ。", "zh": "不用着急，星梨花正在稳步成长，\n我相信今后也一定能继续不断成长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0503_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "11a31e3fc08544c71a72eadd60c62ee31dd42f5fa446ec4c007df8ca062a2b85", "ja": "はい、ありがとうございます！　夢で見た自分に\nなれるように、わたし、がんばりますね！", "zh": "好的，谢谢您！为了成为梦中见到的自己，我会努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0503_1019_p", "source_sha256": "5666ffe3cf25aabf92d7fb9be3fe11c594ed50b61525567a4f233b44226b72b3", "ja": "（未来のことは誰にもわからない。でも夢の中の\n星梨花に近づけるように、精一杯サポートしよう！）", "zh": "（未来的事谁也无法预知。不过，为了让她接近梦中的星梨花，我也要竭尽全力支持她！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
